Subject: [PATCH] ceb-gnrd: reflect confirmed Manual/NTP mode after saving

Do not mutate Vuex state or reset the selected mode before sending the form.
Observe NTP mode updates as well as server updates. Propagate protocol PATCH
and GET errors, read back the applied settings, and report success only when
the returned mode matches the request. Keep the NTP-stop delay for manual
clock updates.

